de on the expression and the composition.\nPlease separate the layers as I would love to use it on a schedule.\nI will credit you as well!\n\nThank you in advance!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1-R05PhPhIgyGozffipjxYW2KHCSU6toz/view?usp=share_link", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@H_arcana/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2573003, "client_id": 1122469, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/504361b0/uploads/origins/1d3ac336-b8f6-4bd0-9411-bb3f02a3e90d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=85d0f2dfa6935ac0c1dfcb171ed5d260", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/504361b0/uploads/origins/1d3ac336-b8f6-4bd0-9411-bb3f02a3e90d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=85d0f2dfa6935ac0c1dfcb171ed5d260, https://si.imgix.net/504361b0/uploads/origins/1d3ac336-b8f6-4bd0-9411-bb3f02a3e90d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6d3b5d869f8401036abcf850a9dc0ab3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/504361b0/uploads/origins/1d3ac336-b8f6-4bd0-9411-bb3f02a3e90d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f8dd2c187ada7b2acff1df859eed3627 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/504361b0/uploads/origins/1d3ac336-b8f6-4bd0-9411-bb3f02a3e90d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=646557ee7f48a961c08065c2cddd7e57", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/504361b0/uploads/origins/1d3ac336-b8f6-4bd0-9411-bb3f02a3e90d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=646557ee7f48a961c08065c2cddd7e57, https://si.imgix.net/504361b0/uploads/origins/1d3ac336-b8f6-4bd0-9411-bb3f02a3e90d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b473094e60d41bf0ae7b11d8ad317537 2x, https://si.imgix.net/504361b0/uploads/origins/1d3ac336-b8f6-4bd0-9411-bb3f02a3e90d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=69a23a59399bf52f147e217f5b6473e2 3x"}, "body": "Harcanaさん、お世話になっております。\n前回同様のオリジナルキャラクターイラストをリクエストさせていただきます。\n\nキャラクターの外見・服装は下記参考URLよりご確認ください。\n衣装の細かい部分については、アレンジしてもらっても問題ありません。\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/89976328\nhttps://twitter.com/sayojinna/status/1478647525553106944\nhttps://www.tumblr.com/sayojinna\n\n剣と魔法のファンタジーな世界観で、クールorちょっぴりセクシーな雰囲気が理想です。\nポージング・シチュエーションはお任せします。\n\nざっくりとした記号でのキャラクターのイメージは魔女・闇属性。\n版権作品で例えるなら、Fate/stay nightシリーズの間桐桜(黒桜)や鋼の錬金術師のプライドをイメージしています。\n\nご縁がありましたら、是非よろしくお願い致します。", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 490057, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "平賀まつり", "screen_name": "hiraga_matsuri", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1869399924431073281/6LKgxcV6.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/18073825/1643924537/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 5, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "video"}], "banned": false, "nc": 160}, {"id": 1736895, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "Jona", "screen_name": "Yonagi_White", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1579092255386005504/fmMH80-p.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/738652963757903872/1713340515/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration